usage: mapper.py [-h]
                 --backbone {resnet18,resnet34,resnet50,resnet101,resnet152}
                 --onnx ONNX [--export-report EXPORT_REPORT]
                 --calibration CALIBRATION --output OUTPUT [--jobs JOBS]
                 [--optimize-level {O0,O1,O2,O3}]
                 [--calibration-type {default,mix,kl,max}]
                 [--max-percentile MAX_PERCENTILE]

Compile one UNet ResNet ONNX model into a verified RDK X5 binary.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --backbone {resnet18,resnet34,resnet50,resnet101,resnet152}
  --onnx ONNX
  --export-report EXPORT_REPORT
                        numerically passed export report; defaults beside the
                        ONNX
  --calibration CALIBRATION
                        directory of RGB float32 CHW .bin samples in range
                        [0,255]
  --output OUTPUT       new run directory
  --jobs JOBS
  --optimize-level {O0,O1,O2,O3}
  --calibration-type {default,mix,kl,max}
  --max-percentile MAX_PERCENTILE
